  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-DodgerBlue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absolute Bio-Energetic Sourcing</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2b/Doctor_Manhattan_%28Movie%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120823081231\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Doctor Manhattan (Movie)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2b/Doctor_Manhattan_%28Movie%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20120823081231\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2b/Doctor_Manhattan_%28Movie%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20120823081231 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2b/Doctor_Manhattan_%28Movie%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120823081231 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Doctor Manhattan (Movie)\" width=\"270\" height=\"320\" data-image-key=\"Doctor_Manhattan_%28Movie%29.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Doctor Manhattan (Movie).jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Jonathan Osterman/Doctor Manhattan (DC Comics) can bodily absorb and store any form of energy on an infinite scale.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Bio-store an infinite amount of ambient energy in your body.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>bio-store an infinite or nearly infinite amount of ambient energy in your body</b>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Energy Absorption\">Absolute Energy Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Living_Power_Plant\" title=\"Living Power Plant\">Living Power Plant</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Bio-Energetic_Sourcing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absolute Bio-Energetic Storage</li>\n<li>Infinite Bio-Energy Absorption</li>\n<li>Ultimate Bio-Capacitor</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Bio-Energetic_Sourcing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user's body is capable of bio-energetically containing an infinite amount of ambient energy, they can absorb as much as they want. This can allow the user the energy required to use other superhuman abilities, survive long amounts of time without food, or output energy for long periods of time.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Bio-Energetic_Sourcing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Energy Absorption\">Absolute Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptive_Energy\" title=\"Adaptive Energy\">Adaptive Energy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Accumulation\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Accumulation\">Bio-Energetic Accumulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Concentration\" title=\"Bio-Energy Concentration\">Bio-Energy Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Regenerative_Healing_Factor\" title=\"Regenerative Healing Factor\">Regenerative Healing Factor</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Attacks\" title=\"Bio-Energy Attacks\">Bio-Energy Attacks</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Infusion\" title=\"Bio-Energy Infusion\">Bio-Energy Infusion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Capacitor\" title=\"Bio-Capacitor\">Bio-Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Conversion\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Conversion\">Bio-Energetic Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Electromagnetic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Electromagnetic Dynamo\">Bio-Electromagnetic Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Electric_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Electric Dynamo\">Bio-Electric Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Photonic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Photonic Dynamo\">Bio-Photonic Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Reactive_Perpetuator\" title=\"Bio-Reactive Perpetuator\">Bio-Reactive Perpetuator</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Transduction\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Transduction\">Bio-Energetic Transduction</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Ionic_Furnace\" title=\"Bio-Ionic Furnace\">Bio-Ionic Furnace</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Ionic_Transformer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bio-Ionic Transformer\">Bio-Ionic Transformer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Kinetic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Kinetic Dynamo\">Bio-Kinetic Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Sonic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Sonic Dynamo\">Bio-Sonic Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fanon:Bio-Teletrans_Perpetuator\" title=\"Fanon:Bio-Teletrans Perpetuator\">Bio-Teletrans Perpetuator</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Cosmic_Transformer\" title=\"Bio-Cosmic Transformer\">Bio-Cosmic Transformer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Gamma_Reactor\" title=\"Bio-Gamma Reactor\">Bio-Gamma Reactor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Gravimetric_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Gravimetric Dynamo\">Bio-Gravimetric Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Matter Manipulation\">Bio-Matter Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Dynamo\">Bio-Nuclear Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Plasma_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Plasma Dynamo\">Bio-Plasma Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Stellar_Transformer\" title=\"Bio-Stellar Transformer\">Bio-Stellar Transformer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Quantum_Perpetuator\" title=\"Bio-Quantum Perpetuator\">Bio-Quantum Perpetuator</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Heat_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Heat Dynamo\">Bio-Heat Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Activation_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Activation Dynamo\">Bio-Activation Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Pyric_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Pyric Dynamo\">Bio-Pyric Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Solar_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Solar Dynamo\">Bio-Solar Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Volatile_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Volatile Dynamo\">Bio-Volatile Dynamo</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energizing\" title=\"Bio-Energizing\">Bio-Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Power_Plant\" title=\"Living Power Plant\">Living Power Plant</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Force Manipulation\">Bio-Force Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Natural_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Natural Energy Manipulation\">Bio-Natural Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Ambient Energy Manipulation\">Ambient Energy Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Empowerment\" title=\"Energy Empowerment\">Energy Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Absolute\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Absolute\">Absolute Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Pinnacle_Condition\" title=\"Pinnacle Condition\">Pinnacle Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Self-Power Augmentation\">Self-Power Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Sustenance\" title=\"Self-Sustenance\">Self-Sustenance</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Enhanced_Physiology\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Energy Enhanced Physiology\">Energy Enhanced Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Immunity\" title=\"Energy Immunity\">Energy Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electromagnetism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electromagnetism\">Personal Electromagnetism</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Energy_Conservation\" title=\"Personal Energy Conservation\">Personal Energy Conservation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Kinetic_Energy\" title=\"Personal Kinetic Energy\">Personal Kinetic Energy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Activation_Energy\" title=\"Personal Activation Energy\">Personal Activation Energy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Equivalence\" title=\"Personal Equivalence\">Personal Equivalence</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Heat\" title=\"Personal Heat\">Personal Heat</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Bio-Energetic_Sourcing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Drain\" title=\"Energy Drain\">Energy Drain</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Total_Drain\" title=\"Total Drain\">Total Drain</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Overload_Immunity\" title=\"Overload Immunity\">Overload Immunity</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Bio-Energetic_Sourcing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden